{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cTQ8Szl4IO1795127291.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣概況：一股強烈東北季候風及一道雲雨帶正影響廣東沿岸。本港今早天氣顯著轉涼，截至上午六時，天文台錄得最低氣溫15.3度，是入秋以來的最低紀錄。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：密雲，有幾陣雨。市區氣溫由初時約17度，下降至稍後約14度，新界再低一兩度，新界部分地區及高地寒冷。吹清勁北至東北風，離岸及高地吹強風。</p><p></p><p>展望：明日漸轉天晴，但早上仍然相當清涼。隨後一兩日雲量增多，風勢頗大，氣溫稍為回升。下週中期再度轉涼。</p><p></p><p>06:20 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T23:24:22.792002+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T22:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T02:37:14.079177+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T23:17:36.976732+00:00","content_hash":"d9de4e11bea86f00a3eed0a33e357442331cd2b0a56b9ed60c9e11c08762dc4a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T23:24:22.792002+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}